    {
      "name": "The Devil's Playground",
      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "featureForm": "reaction",
        "description": "<p>If the PCs defeat the casino's automated security or try to leave with stolen winnings, you can spend an amount of Fear equal to the number of PCs to summon the casino's true owner, a Demon of Avarice, within Close range of a PC. The Demon is immediately spotlighted and bars the party's exit at all costs.</p><section id=\"secret-eOA19GVK1YZHbVwn\" class=\"secret\"><p>How did the demon mask their influence until now? How does the casino itself change to reveal its true nature?</p></section>",
        "attribution": {},
